// asymmetric on purpose: the time is CommonLastUpdatedIRI and the user is
// CommonLastModifiedByIRI, because that is how the rest of the platform names
// them. Advanced search filters on the user under "last modified by", so a
// predicate named for the timestamp instead would answer nothing.
